==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative forms===
* [[cocoanut]]

===Etymology===
From {{compound|coco|nut|lang=en}}.
[[Image:Beached coconut.JPG|thumb|200px|Beached '''coconut'''.]]
[[Image:Coconut.png|thumb|200px|[[Ivory Coast]]ian '''coconut'''.]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈkoʊ.kə.nʌt/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A [[fruit]] of the [[coconut palm]] (not a true nut), ''[[Cocos nucifera]]'', having a [[fibrous]] [[husk]] surrounding a large [[seed]].
# A hard-shelled [[seed]] of this fruit, having white flesh and a [[fluid]]-filled central [[cavity]].
# {{context|uncountable|lang=en}} The [[edible]] white flesh of this fruit.
# The [[coconut palm]].
# {{context|pejorative|ethnic slur|lang=en}} A [[Hispanic]] or dark-skinned person who acts “white” ([[Caucasian]]), [[allude|alluding]] to the fact that a coconut is brown on the outside and white on the inside. Compare {{term|banana||East Asian who acts white|lang=en}}.
# {{context|South Africa|pejorative|lang=en}} A [[black]] person who thinks "white" (European). Compare {{term|banana||East Asian who acts white|lang=en}}.
# {{context|New Zealand|pejorative|lang=en}} A [[Pacific]] [[islander]].
# {{context|slang|lang=en}} A female [[breast]].

====Coordinate terms====
* {{sense|acting white}} {{l|en|banana}}, {{l|en|Oreo}}, {{l|en|Twinkie}}

====Derived terms====
* [[coconut milk]]
* [[coconutty]]

